      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To express it different, it would be nice to have an option to keep the elbow close to the torso. \nThe IK right now does a good job at keeping them out of the torso, but like vellmist mentioned, it moves it quite far away from the torso which looks not-so-cute. \nUnfortunately i don't really know how to make that happen, but you could maybe change the behavior slightly depending on how you rotate your wrist.\nI hope i remember to record a video to show the issue better the next few days",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-02-26T01:54:06.481Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Basically, I really like the new ik, but there is one thing that bothers me.\nIt's that the underarms are too open. It's cuter when she waves with her underarms closed, but when she turns her hands to the other side to greet someone, instead of inside, she ends up with her elbows open in a not-so-cute pose. The only way to solve this is to add a new tracker？",
